Changelog: 17-10-2026 07:36:38

Release 0.2.0.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 07:30:38

Fixed. The app's folder in the suite is apps/ace (was apps/ace-queues) and its package is ace_queues (was
bc250_ace_queues): the suite's naming convention (owner, 17-10-2026), a short folder name and the package named
after the app without the BC-250 prefix. With the folder go its key in the portal, its chapter of the wiki
(apps/ace/), its installer test and its release tags: ace-v<x.y.z> from the next release on, which is also what
the app's update check looks for. The installed app keeps its name, its launcher bc250-ace-queues, its script,
its settings and its state folders; the portal moves its record of the installed copy to the new key.

